OL,5,G2100 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe search is on for a stolen
OL,7,     Fhigh-performance motor, reportedly
OL,8,     Fused by suspects armed with
OL,9,     Fbaseball bats. Phil faces an
OL,10,     Felectric scooter standoff with an
OL,11,     Fillegal rider.
OL,12,G2200 Highway Thru Hell
OL,13,     FJamie's new BC crew struggles with
OL,14,     Fa badly mangled trailer on a
OL,15,     Fdangerous blind corner. When Colin
OL,16,     Fslips up on a big recovery in
OL,17,     FAlberta, Jamie's brother has to
OL,18,     Ftake over the job.
